{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>A frame.</b> As the Targum renders: גְּדַנְפָא. And the Sages of Israel disagreed about the matter: some say it was above, surrounding the table like the לְבִזְבְּזִין on the edge of nobles' tables; and some say it was below, set from leg to leg on the four sides of the table, and the tabletop rests on that frame." "<b>And you shall make a golden crown for its frame.</b> It is the crown mentioned above; explain to yourself here that it was on the frame."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:54:30.575292564Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}